From 9a8b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bare Browser <noreply@localhost>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 71/72] Add touch and letter navigation gestures

Introduces Vivaldi/Opera-inspired touch and shape gestures for Android:

- Edge swipe navigation: Swiping from the left/right screen edges navigates back
  and forward with haptic feedback.
- Letter and shape gesture recognizer: Robust directional vector and curvature
  classifier that reliably recognizes drawing 'C' (Close / Cerrar) to close open
  tabs without false triggers during normal vertical scrolling.
- Real-time gesture trail overlay: Renders a smooth, glowing line with fade-out
  animation while the user is drawing a gesture.
- Dedicated Navigation Gestures panel in Settings: Configurable toggles for edge
  swipes, shape recognition, and trail rendering.
